<title>BELGIUM: De Silguy says earlier lira in ERM the better.</title>
<headline>De Silguy says earlier lira in ERM the better.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Monetary Affairs Commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy said on Wednesday the European Commission wanted as many currencies in the exchange rate mechanism as possible.</p>
<p>&quot;The earlier the lira can be brought in, the better,&quot; he told a news conference in answer to a question about the Italian currency.</p>
<p>Italy is expected to apply to bring the lira into the ERM again by the end of the year.</p>
<p>Brussels Newsroom -- + 32 2 287-6830</p>
